      "description": "Root cause. Immediately after consuming a backslash, `consumeTerm()` dereferences `*current_` without checking whether `current_` has reached `end_`. When the pattern ends in a lone backslash, the missing guard turns the intended `EscapeIncomplete` error path into an out-of-bounds read."
